@startuml UC10_SaveLoad_UseCase
title UC10 - Save / Load Game (Use Case Diagram)
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Save/Load System" {
  (Save Game)
  (Load Game)
  (Collect Game State)
  (Serialize Player data)
  (Write to users.json)
  (Display Save confirmation)
  (Read from users.json)
  (Deserialize Player data)
  (Restore GameSession)
  (Resume gameplay)
}

Player --> (Save Game)
Player --> (Load Game)

(Save Game) --> (Collect Game State) : <<include>>
(Collect Game State) --> (Serialize Player data)
(Serialize Player data) --> (Write to users.json)
(Write to users.json) --> (Display Save confirmation)
(Display Save confirmation) --> Player

(Load Game) --> (Read from users.json) : <<include>>
(Read from users.json) --> (Deserialize Player data)
(Deserialize Player data) --> (Restore GameSession)
(Restore GameSession) --> (Resume gameplay)
(Resume gameplay) --> Player

@enduml
